533
00:21:36,336 --> 00:21:37,713
Anything going on there?

534
00:21:37,755 --> 00:21:40,340
Anybody you like?

535
00:21:43,636 --> 00:21:44,887
No.

536
00:21:44,929 --> 00:21:46,346
No.

537
00:21:46,388 --> 00:21:47,598
There is.

538
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:48,891
You're blushing.

539
00:21:48,933 --> 00:21:50,810
No, I'm not blushing.

540
00:21:50,851 --> 00:21:51,811
I'm sunburned.

541
00:21:51,852 --> 00:21:54,772
From, you know, the rain.

542
00:21:54,814 --> 00:21:55,773
You like someone.

543
00:21:55,815 --> 00:21:57,608
Tell me who it is.
Who is it?

544
00:21:57,650 --> 00:21:58,859
No. Joey!

545
00:21:58,901 --> 00:22:00,319
Come on, who?
Who do you like? Tell me.

546
00:22:00,360 --> 00:22:02,571
