555
00:22:18,879 --> 00:22:20,714
Okay, okay.

556
00:22:20,756 --> 00:22:22,925
You really want
to know who it is?

557
00:22:22,967 --> 00:22:24,135
Yeah. Who is it?

558
00:22:24,177 --> 00:22:26,137
Do you?
Yeah.

559
00:22:26,179 --> 00:22:27,847
Hey.

560
00:22:27,888 --> 00:22:28,806
Hey.

561
00:22:28,848 --> 00:22:30,057
