a message.

562
00:22:30,099 --> 00:22:31,725
Ross and I were going
to go grab a bite,

563
00:22:31,767 --> 00:22:32,893
but now that you're here,

564
00:22:32,935 --> 00:22:34,895
maybe we could go
have that dinner.

565
00:22:34,937 --> 00:22:36,063
Right. Of course.

566
00:22:36,105 --> 00:22:38,649
Hey, did you guys
finish the speech?

567
00:22:38,691 --> 00:22:40,358
Yep, we got it.
We got it.

568
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:41,401
Thank you so much.

569
00:22:41,443 --> 00:22:42,528
I had a great time.

570
00:22:42,569 --> 00:22:43,570
Yeah.
Yeah.

571
00:22:43,612 --> 00:22:44,738
Hey, look,
and this isn't over,

572
00:22:44,780 --> 00:22:46,199
because I really want
to know who...

573
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:47,783
Later, later.

574
00:22:47,825 --> 00:22:49,869
So, um, shall we?

575
00:22:49,910 --> 00:22:50,911
Yeah.

576
00:22:50,953 --> 00:22:51,871
Okay. Bye.

577
00:22:51,912 --> 00:22:53,122
Okay, good night.

578
00:22:53,164 --> 00:22:54,790
Night.

579
00:22:58,085 --> 00:23:01,214
( sighs )

580
00:23:01,255 --> 00:23:02,756
Okay, good night.

581
00:23:02,798 --> 00:23:04,550
Night, Ross.

582
00:23:08,929 --> 00:23:11,557
I can't believe she's going
to say yes to David

583
00:23:11,598 --> 00:23:13,391
