588
00:23:27,281 --> 00:23:28,615
Oh, my God,
he's going to do it now.

589
00:23:28,657 --> 00:23:30,450
Please, I cannot watch this.
Let's go.

590
00:23:30,492 --> 00:23:31,744
I think we have some time.

591
00:23:31,785 --> 00:23:33,371
Have you ever heard him talk?

592
00:23:33,411 --> 00:23:37,124
"Uh, Phoebe, um, I would be
