we spent apart was,
was... unbearable.

597
00:23:51,389 --> 00:23:55,268
Of course, the sanitation
strikes in Minsk didn't help.

598
00:23:55,309 --> 00:23:57,019
Sure, okay, yeah.

599
00:23:57,061 --> 00:24:00,981
But, um, well, now
