601
00:24:03,441 --> 00:24:07,780
So to that end...

602
00:24:09,823 --> 00:24:10,908
Oh, my God, Mike.

603
00:24:10,950 --> 00:24:13,911
It's David, actually.

604
00:24:13,953 --> 00:24:15,746
No, Mike's here.

605
00:24:16,747 --> 00:24:18,916
Oh, hey, Mike.

606
00:24:18,958 --> 00:24:22,502
Hi, David.

607
00:24:22,544 --> 00:24:23,963
Chandler.

608
00:24:24,462 --> 00:24:26,340
Moni... Oh.

609
00:24:29,051 --> 00:24:31,971
