610
00:24:34,472 --> 00:24:35,599
Hi, Phoebe.

611
00:24:35,641 --> 00:24:37,435
What are you doing here?

612
00:24:37,475 --> 00:24:40,229
I have a question
I need to ask you.

613
00:24:40,271 --> 00:24:43,232
I have a question
I was kind of going

614
00:24:43,274 --> 00:24:44,442
to ask her myself.

615
00:24:44,482 --> 00:24:46,819
Yeah, I understand,
but before you do,

616
00:24:46,860 --> 00:24:49,613
she really needs
to hear this.

617
00:24:50,864 --> 00:24:52,366
Okay.

618
00:24:52,408 --> 00:24:54,994
Would you care
for my seat as well?

619
00:24:55,035 --> 00:24:57,037
Actually, yeah, that'd be great.

620
00:24:58,247 --> 00:24:59,123
Well, that's fair.

621
00:24:59,165 --> 00:25:01,292
You've had a long trip.

622
00:25:11,344 --> 00:25:13,595
Phoebe, I love you.

623
00:25:13,637 --> 00:25:16,598
I've missed you so much
these last few months.

624
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:18,976
And I thought we were
apart for a good reason.

625
00:25:19,018 --> 00:25:20,353
But then,
I suddenly realized

626
00:25:20,394 --> 00:25:21,895
that there was no reason
good enough

627
00:25:21,937 --> 00:25:24,606
to keep me from spending
the rest of my life with you.

628
00:25:24,648 --> 00:25:27,734
Uh... I-I...
this kind of steps on the toes

629
00:25:27,776 --> 00:25:30,321
of what I was going to say.

630
00:25:31,155 --> 00:25:32,198
I'm sorry, David.

631
00:25:32,239 --> 00:25:33,866
But she really
has to know this.

632
00:25:33,907 --> 00:25:37,495
All right, but after this,
I want to see you outside.

633
00:25:37,535 --> 00:25:39,913
If the rain stops.

634
00:25:41,290 --> 00:25:46,086
You're the most
incredible woman
I've ever met.

635
00:25:46,128 --> 00:25:48,297
How could I lose you?

636
00:25:49,965 --> 00:25:51,591
Now, I don't actually
have a ring.

637
00:25:51,633 --> 00:25:53,135
I-I-I have a ring.

638
00:25:53,177 --> 00:25:55,679
I wouldn't brag too much
about that thing, big guy.

639
00:25:56,514 --> 00:25:58,974
Phoebe...

640
00:25:59,016 --> 00:26:01,227
will you marry me?

641
00:26:05,481 --> 00:26:07,400
No.

642
00:26:07,983 --> 00:26:11,611
Um... ha-ha.

643
00:26:14,323 --> 00:26:15,824
I love you.

644
00:26:15,866 --> 00:26:18,618
But I never needed
