645
00:26:18,660 --> 00:26:21,497
I just needed to know
that we were headed somewhere.

646
00:26:21,539 --> 00:26:23,623
You know, that we had a future.

647
00:26:23,665 --> 00:26:27,794
We can have
any future you want.

648
00:26:32,758 --> 00:26:36,303
Okay, well, I'm, uh...
I'm gonna take off.

649
00:26:36,345 --> 00:26:37,471
Oh, God, David,

650
00:26:37,513 --> 00:26:40,224
I'm so sorry.
I'm sorry.

651
00:26:40,266 --> 00:26:41,850
Just so I know, uh...

652
00:26:41,892 --> 00:26:43,394
if I had asked first...

653
00:26:43,436 --> 00:26:46,688
Yeah, I-I...
I might have said yes.

654
00:26:46,730 --> 00:26:49,983
But that would've been wrong.
I mean...

655
00:26:50,025 --> 00:26:53,695
Please, you don't
have to explain.

656
00:26:53,737 --> 00:26:55,613
Perhaps if I hadn't
gone to Minsk,

657
00:26:55,655 --> 00:26:57,824
