675
00:27:51,044 --> 00:27:53,631
Uh, ladies,
Ross's speech is in 45 minutes.

676
00:27:53,671 --> 00:27:55,882
No!
Damn it!

677
00:27:56,216 --> 00:27:59,886
ROSS:
Walls are pretty
thin, guys.

678
00:28:04,558 --> 00:28:05,851
Then we have to weigh the data

679
00:28:05,892 --> 00:28:09,355
