688
00:28:31,544 --> 00:28:32,919
Argentinosaurus.

689
00:28:32,961 --> 00:28:35,881
Not to mention
"Coldsaurus."

690
00:28:38,758 --> 00:28:40,177
And that's just the herbivores.

691
00:28:40,219 --> 00:28:42,471
