697
00:28:52,981 --> 00:28:54,608
Really?

698
00:28:56,109 --> 00:28:57,444
But all kidding aside...

699
00:28:57,486 --> 00:29:00,113
In much the same way
that Homo ergaster

700
00:29:00,155 --> 00:29:04,451
