712
00:29:29,727 --> 00:29:32,145
( laughs )

713
00:29:32,187 --> 00:29:35,941
In a very real way,
we can bring the Mesozoic Era

714
00:29:35,982 --> 00:29:38,485
into the 21st century.

715
00:29:38,527 --> 00:29:40,070
Thank you.

716
00:29:40,112 --> 00:29:44,074
