Really great.

719
00:29:47,620 --> 00:29:48,870
Oh, thanks, guys.

720
00:29:48,912 --> 00:29:51,498
I thought it
was wonderful.
Oh.

721
00:29:51,540 --> 00:29:53,792
Jarvis Oberblau. Cornell.

722
00:29:53,833 --> 00:29:56,128
I mean, the ideas
you put forth.

723
00:29:56,169 --> 00:30:00,716
And from someone
so young and...

724
00:30:05,178 --> 00:30:08,807
Okay, now we're
just holding hands.

725
00:30:08,848 --> 00:30:10,142
All right.

726
00:30:10,183 --> 00:30:11,310
Well, um, we're gonna
hit the beach.

727
00:30:11,351 --> 00:30:12,770
It was really great.

728
00:30:12,811 --> 00:30:14,187
Oh, thank you so much.

729
00:30:14,229 --> 00:30:16,273
And so funny.

730
00:30:16,940 --> 00:30:17,941
Take it easy.

731
00:30:17,983 --> 00:30:19,151
Okay.
All right, thanks.

732
00:30:19,192 --> 00:30:20,694
Thanks so much.

733
00:30:20,736 --> 00:30:23,280
I can't tell you
how much it means to me
that you were here.

734
00:30:23,322 --> 00:30:26,908
What, are you kidding?
We wouldn't have missed it.

735
00:30:26,950 --> 00:30:28,619
Oh.

736
00:30:28,661 --> 00:30:30,454
I'm back.

737
00:30:30,496 --> 00:30:33,039
Okay.

738
00:30:33,081 --> 00:30:34,874
