739
00:30:34,916 --> 00:30:36,126
Hey.

740
00:30:36,168 --> 00:30:37,252
Well?

741
00:30:37,294 --> 00:30:38,420
You were incredible.

742
00:30:38,462 --> 00:30:39,505
I mean, you blew
them away.

743
00:30:39,546 --> 00:30:41,256
I can't tell you
how great it was

744
00:30:41,298 --> 00:30:43,717
