749
00:30:52,309 --> 00:30:55,521
Oh, my God,
I'm your groupie.

750
00:30:55,562 --> 00:30:59,858
I better not find you
naked in my hotel room.

751
00:31:03,278 --> 00:31:06,198
Look, I took it too far.

752
00:31:11,036 --> 00:31:13,747
Oh, I can't believe
it's raining again.

753
00:31:13,789 --> 00:31:15,374
It's so unfair.

754
00:31:15,415 --> 00:31:17,083
Well, on the bright side,
now we won't have to see

755
00:31:17,125 --> 00:31:21,839
