with their shirts off.

756
00:31:21,879 --> 00:31:25,843
Not you guys.

757
00:31:25,884 --> 00:31:29,179
You've got it going on.

758
00:31:31,724 --> 00:31:33,058
So what are we
gonna do today?

759
00:31:33,099 --> 00:31:34,560
They have a game
