760
00:31:34,601 --> 00:31:36,520
I think they have like,
ping-pong and stuff.

761
00:31:36,562 --> 00:31:37,937
Ping-pong?!

762
00:31:37,979 --> 00:31:39,815
Honey, they have ping-pong.
Let's play.

763
00:31:39,857 --> 00:31:41,608
